  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Abdullah \"Abby\" Mina served Cleveland's Arab American community through organizational leadership, board service, and faith-based civic work. He was the longest-serving president of the Cleveland American Middle East Organization, known as CAMEO, supported the International Services Center and ACCESS, and led advisory work for Saint Elias Melkite Greek Catholic Church."
    ]
